<https://w3id.org/desmos/TextualFeature> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Caratteristica testuale"@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/TextualFeature> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/desmos/> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/TextualFeature> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Caratteristica osservabile di un'espressione testuale che può indicare la presenza di una costrizione letteraria. In DeSMòS è intesa come evidenza intratestuale: una traccia testuale che supporta l’identificazione della costrizione, senza implicare di per sé sufficienza o necessità. Le proprietà che possono essere usate con questa classe sono crm:P3_has_note, desmos:isFeatureOf e desmos:revealsConstraint."@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/TextualFeature> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An observable feature of a textual expression that may indicate the presence of a literary constraint. In DeSMòS it is treated as intratextual evidence: a textual trace supporting the identification of a constraint, without implying necessity or sufficiency by itself. The properties that can be used with this class are crm:P3_has_note, desmos:isFeatureOf and desmos:revealsConstraint."@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/TextualFeature> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Textual feature"@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/TextualFeature> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/TextualFeature> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E28_Conceptual_Object> .
